```
Reason:
The bug occurs because `skb_pull()` can fail even when `pskb_inet_may_pull()` returns true. This can happen when applications create malformed packets, such as those without an IP header. If `skb_pull()` is called under these conditions, it may lead to accessing uninitialized memory, resulting in undefined behavior.

